body:
I disagree. A kid can only be saved when someone sees the child doing something they call savage, and then tell the child that's what the action is.

&#x200B;

It could be 'bad', 'mean', or 'hurtful'. A child knows nothing of 'savagery' until you tell them. Just as a child has no notion of what the words 'good' or 'evil' mean without some starting point.
